==English==

===Etymology===
{{rfe}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|arithmetic|lang=en}} A number or quantity from which another is to be subtracted.
#: ''In the subtraction 10 &minus; 4, 10 is the minuend.''

